WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
Keyword match types help you control where your ads appear.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.880
There are three ways to set them in your campaigns.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.195
First, you can use Amazon's suggested keywords.

00:00:08.195 --> 00:00:12.609
By default, each one includes the three match types to choose from,
 "

00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:14.080
Broad", "Phrase", and "Exact".

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.900
Add whichever match types you'd like to your targeting.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.006
If you're entering your own list of keywords, make sure the match types you want to include

00:00:22.006 --> 00:00:23.420
are checked off at the top.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.671
Lastly, you can bulk upload a list of keywords.

00:00:26.671 --> 00:00:30.340
In this case, our template includes a column for the match type.
